स कृत्वा राजसं त्यागं नैव त्यागफलं लभेत् ॥ ८ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4478,\"bb\":3930,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/8/b3930/\",\"body_value\":\"duḥkham ity eva yat karma
kāya-kleśa-bhayāt tyajet
sa kṛtvā rājasaṁ tyāgaṁ
naiva tyāga-phalaṁ labhet\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4479,\"bb\":3931,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/8/b3931/\",\"shadow_value\":\"duḥkham – unhappy; iti – thus; eva – certainly; yat – which; karma – work; kāya – for the body; kleśa – trouble; bhayāt – out of fear; tyajet – gives up; saḥ – he; kṛtvā – after doing; rājasam – in the mode of passion; tyāgam – renunciation; na – not; eva – certainly; tyāga – of renunciation; phalam – the results; labhet – gains.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"duḥkham\",\"translation\":\"unhappy\"},{\"word\":\"iti\",\"translation\":\"thus\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"yat\",\"translation\":\"which\"},{\"word\":\"karma\",\"translation\":\"work\"},{\"word\":\"kāya\",\"translation\":\"for the body\"},{\"word\":\"kleśa\",\"translation\":\"trouble\"},{\"word\":\"bhayāt\",\"translation\":\"out of fear\"},{\"word\":\"tyajet\",\"translation\":\"gives up\"},{\"word\":\"saḥ\",\"translation\":\"he\"},{\"word\":\"kṛtvā\",\"translation\":\"after doing\"},{\"word\":\"rājasam\",\"translation\":\"in the mode of passion\"},{\"word\":\"tyāgam\",\"translation\":\"renunciation\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"not\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"tyāga\",\"translation\":\"of renunciation\"},{\"word\":\"phalam\",\"translation\":\"the results\"},{\"word\":\"labhet\",\"translation\":\"gains\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4480,\"bb\":3932,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/8/b3932/\",\"body_value\":\"Anyone who gives up prescribed duties as troublesome or out of fear of bodily discomfort is said to have renounced in the mode of passion. Such action never leads to the elevation of renunciation.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4481,\"bb\":3933,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/8/b3933/\",\"body_value\":\"One who is in Kṛṣṇa consciousness should not give up earning money out of fear that he is performing fruitive activities. If by working one can engage his money in Kṛṣṇa consciousness, or if by rising early in the morning one can advance his transcendental Kṛṣṇa consciousness, one should not desist out of fear or because such activities are considered troublesome. Such renunciation is in the mode of passion. The result of passionate work is always miserable. If a person renounces work in that spirit, he never gets the result of renunciation.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 18.8\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 18.8\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"29:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\"